  "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{1}{5}$ on the left and $\\frac{1}{15}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14133144/assets/bafb6b86ebc3c330d202cb340c7d7a5fbea2982e689bc9e8c8cbce74e50d49fe.png)\n\nTherefore, the division problem shown is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}÷3=\\frac{1}{15}.\n$$",
